{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人生必吃炙燒焦糖芝士蛋糕！</p><p>韓國爆紅芝士蛋糕 Golden Cheese登港</p><p>震撼消息！韓國被譽為「芝士蛋糕界愛馬仕」 、高級芝士蛋糕品牌 Golden Cheese（골든치즈），首間海外官方快閃店將於9月24日登陸啟德 AIRSIDE！每盒由韓國直送到港，每日限量發售100件，勢掀搶購熱潮！</p><p>焦點！焦糖脆皮炙燒服務</p><p>香港首站將韓國門市的招牌「火炙焦糖專區」移師過來，凡加選焦糖脆皮炙燒服務，店員便會即場撒糖，以高溫焦糖烙鐵將砂糖炙燒成金黃酥脆的法式焦糖脆皮，配上綿密如雪糕口感的芝士蛋糕，讓人想一吃再吃。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945205615894765_10079447066aa8df1893c1a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945205846089309_20078532636aa8df1ada7f6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945206017224969_18032719506aa8df1ccba5c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1789452062811335_9559701886aa8df1f4483c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945206460246403_7372111056aa8df21139d7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945206646661755_13834620556aa8df231eb17.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178945206852711940_13898793496aa8df250ba1b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T06:20:52.214194+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}